                "description": "The Providence Crystal Knob with Round Rose is easy to install and comes with all the necessary installation hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This clear crystal knobset has a sandcast bronze rosette that is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Clear Crystal Providence Knobset with #2 Rose has a lovely, romantic style that makes it a great choice for historic homes and thoughtful remodels of older homes.\r\n",
